### Add Product
POST http://localhost:3080/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
{
  "title": "حاسوب",
  "price": 7000
}

### Get Products
GET http://localhost:3080/products
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Get Product
GET http://localhost:3080/products/4
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN


### Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:3080/products/1
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN


